        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-LGN08016-IPE, 16 Inch Ipe Back-to-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 16 Inch Ipe Door Handle with Stainless Steel End Caps comes packaged as a back-to-back pair. It has a 1-1/2 inch diameter grip made out of solid, unfinished Ipe. The sleeves and the brackets are both finished in polished stainless steel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Laguna Back-to-Back Door Handle in Ipe:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Ipe</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket and End Cap Finish: Polished Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
